      ":question/worked-solution": "- $B$ is upper triangular: **true**. All entries below the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 1, column 4 is $6\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 4, column 1 is $-6\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -6 & -6 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
